# Quick specs

For **small** changes (bugfix, single-module tweak, ≤3 obvious steps).

Copy [_template.md](_template.md) to `<slug>.md` or inline criteria in [docs/workflow/next_actions.md](../../docs/workflow/next_actions.md).

Skip this folder when the change needs design or a task breakdown — use `.specs/features/<slug>/` instead.
